<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CEC Club – Year-End Reflection</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="cec-club-reflection/css/style.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <header class="header">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header__content"><a class="header__logo" href="/"><span class="header__logo-text">CEC</span><span class="header__logo-text header__logo-text--light">CLUB</span></a>
                <nav class="header__nav">
                    <ul class="header__nav-list">
                        <li class="header__nav-item"><a class="header__nav-link" href="/">Home</a></li>
                        <li class="header__nav-item"><a class="header__nav-link" href="about.html">About</a></li>
                        <li class="header__nav-item"><a class="header__nav-link" href="events.html">Events</a></li>
                        <li class="header__nav-item"><a class="header__nav-link" href="projects.html">Projects</a></li>
                        <li class="header__nav-item"><a class="header__nav-link" href="contact.html">Contact</a></li>
                        <li class="header__nav-item"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="join.html">Join Us</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </nav>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero section bg-darker py-xxxl">
        <div class="container text-center color-text">
            <h1 class="hero__title font-size-xxl font-weight-bold">Let’s Reflect on Our Year</h1>
            <p class="hero__subtitle font-size-lg color-text-muted">
                From foundational workshops to insightful conferences, we shared knowledge and built skills together. Now let’s hear from you.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Storytelling Feedback Sections -->
    <main>
        <!-- Act 1: The Beginning - Igniting Our Passion -->
        <section class="act section bg-darker py-xxxl">
            <div class="container">
                <h2 class="act__heading font-size-xl font-weight-bold color-primary">🎬 Act 1: The Beginning - Igniting Our Passion</h2>
                <p class="act__description color-text-muted">
                    Our year started with energy, setting the stage for learning and collaboration. We kicked off with foundational sessions and welcomed new members.
                </p>
                <h3 class="font-size-lg font-weight-bold color-primary mb-xl">Early Milestones:</h3>
                <div class="icon-list">
                    <div class="icon-list__item">
                        <span class="icon-list__icon">💡</span>
                        <span class="icon-list__text">Introduction to Web &amp; Mobile Development basics.</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="icon-list__item">
                        <span class="icon-list__icon">🔗</span>
                        <span class="icon-list__text">Launching our 3-session Web Development Formation with Fakhredine.</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="icon-list__item">
                        <span class="icon-list__icon">📊</span>
                        <span class="icon-list__text">Dive into Big Data &amp; Artificial Intelligence fundamentals.</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="icon-list__item">
                        <span class="icon-list__icon">💼</span>
                        <span class="icon-list__text">Practical workshop on creating a professional Portfolio.</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="icon-list__item">
                        <span class="icon-list__icon">🤝</span>
                        <span class="icon-list__text">Welcoming and onboarding new CEC members.</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="act__prompt mt-xxxl">
                    <label class="color-text">
                        Thinking back to the start, what motivated you to join the club and participate in these early activities?
                    </label>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Act 2: Milestones & Memorable Moments -->
        <section class="act section bg-darker py-xxxl">
            <div class="container">
                <h2 class="act__heading font-size-xl font-weight-bold color-primary">🎉 Act 2: Milestones &amp; Memorable Moments</h2>
                <p class="act__description color-text-muted">
                    We reached new heights and had moments that truly defined our year, bringing the community together and expanding our horizons.
                </p>
                <h3 class="font-size-lg font-weight-bold color-primary mb-xl">Key Highlights:</h3>
                <div class="icon-list">
                    <div class="icon-list__item">
                        <span class="icon-list__icon">🎤</span>
                        <span class="icon-list__text">Our successful "GeeksBlabla On Campus" conference, bringing industry experts to ENSAB.</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="icon-list__item">
                        <span class="icon-list__icon">✅</span>
                        <span class="icon-list__text">Successful completion of our foundational formations (Web Dev, etc.).</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="icon-list__item">
                        <span class="icon-list__icon">🤝</span>
                        <span class="icon-list__text">Engaging workshops that provided practical skills and knowledge.</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="act__prompt mt-xxxl">
                    <label class="color-text">
                        From all the events and projects, which specific moment meant the most to you, and why?
                    </label>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Act 3: Navigating Challenges -->
        <section class="act section bg-darker py-xxxl">
            <div class="container">
                <h2 class="act__heading font-size-xl font-weight-bold color-primary">📉 Act 3: Navigating Challenges</h2>
                <p class="act__description color-text-muted">
                    Every journey has its challenges, and sometimes the pace shifts. Reflecting honestly helps us learn and grow stronger for the future.
                </p>
                <div class="act__prompt mt-xxxl">
                    <label class="color-text">
                        What do you feel were the main obstacles or areas where we could improve this year? Be honest, your feedback is safe and valuable.
                    </label>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Act 4: Charting the Course Forward -->
        <section class="act section bg-darker py-xxxl">
            <div class="container">
                <h2 class="act__heading font-size-xl font-weight-bold color-primary">🔮 Act 4: Charting the Course Forward</h2>
                <p class="act__description color-text-muted">
                    Your insights are crucial for shaping the future of the CE Club. Let's think about what next year could look like.
                </p>
                <div class="act__prompt mt-xxxl">
                    <label class="color-text">
                        Write a message or piece of advice for future club members or the next organizing committee. What should they know or strive for?
                    </label>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <!-- Feedback Form Section -->
    <section class="feedback-form section bg-darker py-xxxl">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="feedback-form__title font-size-xl font-weight-bold color-primary text-center mb-xxxl">Share Your Full Reflection</h2>
            <p class="color-text-muted text-center mb-xl">
                Thank you for taking the time to reflect with us. Please use the form below to share your thoughts on each question.
            </p>
            <form name="contact" method="POST" data-netlify="true" class="feedback-form__form">
                <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact">

                <p>
                    <label for="form-act1-question" class="color-text">
                        Thinking back to the start, what motivated you to join the club and participate in these early activities?
                    </label>
                    <textarea id="form-act1-question" name="act1-question" rows="4" required></textarea>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <label for="form-act2-question" class="color-text">
                        From all the events and projects, which specific moment meant the most to you, and why?
                    </label>
                    <textarea id="form-act2-question" name="act2-question" rows="4"></textarea>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <label for="form-act3-question" class="color-text">
                        What do you feel were the main obstacles or areas where we could improve this year? Be honest, your feedback is safe and valuable.
                    </label>
                    <textarea id="form-act3-question" name="act3-question" rows="4"></textarea>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <label for="form-act4-question" class="color-text">
                        Write a message or piece of advice for future club members or the next organizing committee. What should they know or strive for?
                    </label>
                    <textarea id="form-act4-question" name="act4-question" rows="8"></textarea>
                </p>
                <p class="text-center">
                    <button type="submit" class="feedback-form__submit-button">Send Reflection</button>
                </p>
            </form>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Milestones Carousel Section -->
    <section class="milestones-carousel section bg-darker py-xxxl">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="milestones-carousel__title font-size-xl font-weight-bold color-primary text-center mb-xxxl">Our Year in Milestones</h2>
            <div class="carousel-container">
                <div class="carousel-track" id="milestones-track">
                    <!-- Milestones will be dynamically loaded here -->
                </div>
                <button class="carousel-button carousel-button--prev">&#10094;</button>
                <button class="carousel-button carousel-button--next">&#10095;</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="footer section bg-darker py-xl text-center color-text-muted">
        <div class="container">
            <p>Thank you for being part of CE Club!</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="cec-club-reflection/js/carousel.js"></script>
</body>
</html>


